{"message":"The strongest documented sign-up offer is the EcoCard: earn 2,000 sustainability points (worth $20 as a statement or checking-account credit) after spending $5,000 in eligible purchases within the first month. However, that offer was only available for accounts opened from August 1 through December 15, 2025, so I can’t confirm it is still active.

A previously advertised Silver Rewards Card offer provided a $500 statement credit after $2,000 in purchases within the first month, but its offer window ended June 30, 2025. I also found no currently confirmed active points-or-cash-back sign-up bonus in the available information.

For ongoing rewards rather than a sign-up bonus, the Gold Rewards Card earns 2.5% cash back on all purchases, has no annual fee, and requires an active Rho-Bank+ subscription; a minimum 720 credit score is listed. If you tell me whether you want a personal or business card and roughly how much you expect to spend in the first month, I can help compare the best fit."}
